{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Just Another Supermarket\u00a0</strong>is a fast-paced, chaotic supermarket simulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Supermarket Simulator to rule them all, it has everything: building system, economy, management, research trees, upgrades, stubborn customers, sneaky little thieves, zombies(?)...zombies?? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Yep, it has zombies, when the night falls you have to protect your lovely retail gem. Good luck with that!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Nice Little Building System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382350/extras/ezgif-79a6d19130b2df.gif?t=1744059845\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your store, your decoration, your imagination. Who knows better? An architect? An interior designer? NOOO, it's you who played that life sim all of your childhood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Niaah that's What the Low Rent was About</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382350/extras/ezgif-8df7492573eef4__1_.gif?t=1744059845\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Woohooy our cutie little store is full of people, better get to work!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Filthy Little Thieves</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382350/extras/ezgif-5482d444578117.gif?t=1744059845\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Camera System is your friend, or better, security staff, or even better z-ray laser turrets, unlock them all and never miss a penny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebac